#Bossloot-drop-off-Single by Stephanius 2026/08/11
#adapted from Templer s drop-off script
#changes for distro chest patch
# - move gold into distros, stacking it, not anymore into the gold box in the NCO chest
# - move rares into distros in stacks, stacking them, no longer splitting them into 1s
# - not checking for stacked rares anymore
# - mini-Rares, including arcane scrolls, are moved into the distro as a full stack (the distro chest splits them).
# - CFC: removed the mini-loot chest and the split option.
# - added tax switch for RMs
# This should run faster and cause less problems since there are less lift and drop pairs.
#Removed section checking for stacked rares in Distro, it was commented out, but did execute for me.
#Adapted for CFC: all guild containers are configured in the GUILD CONTAINERS section below (CFC_... values).

@clearignore

### GUILD CONTAINERS ###
# Serials of your guild's containers. Use >info in game to get a container's serial.
# Set a value to 0 and the script will ask you to target that container instead.
# The chosen containers are remembered (BDO... variables) until they are out of range.
#
# ROOM LAYOUT: stand where every chest below is within 2 tiles of you.
# You also need, within reach:
# - an item recycler (found automatically by type, the script STOPS without one)
# - optional "tax switches": lock down a Master Crafting Diagram, a pink Arcane Scroll
#   or Research Materials within 8 tiles to make that item a guild tax item
#   (it then goes to the NCO main chest instead of a distro)
#
# HOW LOOT FLOWS (backpack and CFC Public Chest are both emptied):
#   CFC Public Chest / backpack
#     -> rares, rare cloth, accessory dye, maps, gold -> Distro One (overflow: Distro Two)
#     -> mini-rares                                    -> Distro Two
#     -> boss tokens                                  -> Boss tokens container
#     -> tax items, legendary T8 maps                 -> NCO main
#     -> raw resources                                 -> NCO resources chest (inside NCO main)
#     -> unidentified magic items                      -> recycler
#
# --- DISTRO ONE: main boss loot distro ---
# Gets the valuable loot: aspect cores, distillations, skill orbs and scrolls, survival gear,
# spell hue deeds, dungeon seeds, dyes, carpet tiles, MCDs/RMs (if not taxed), rare cloth,
# accessory dye, treasure and resource maps, gold, checks and doubloons.
# At the end the script opens its distribution gump so YOU hand the loot out to the players.
# Must be a 'distribution chest'.
@setvar! CFC_DistroOne 0x4630999E
# --- DISTRO TWO: mini-rares and overflow ---
# Always gets the mini-rares: arcane scrolls (if not taxed), plant chemicals,
# phylacteries, carpet dye, melloweed leaves, mount gear dye.
# Also gets Distro One's loot when Distro One is full.
@setvar! CFC_DistroTwo 0x40FD50C6
# --- CFC PUBLIC CHEST: drop-off chest where members put their boss loot ---
# Anyone in the group should be able to drop into it. The script empties it completely;
# arcane runes are taken out into your backpack. The final distribution only starts when
# the CFC Public Chest shows "(0 items", otherwise the script starts over.
@setvar! CFC_PublicChest 0x583561C4
# --- NCO MAIN: secure guild storage for things that are NOT distributed ---
# Gets arcane essence, mastery chain links (and boss tokens if there is no token container),
# legendary T8 treasure maps (hue 2091), MCDs/RMs/arcane scrolls when taxed,
# and any resources/tax items found in the distros by the verify step.
# It must also contain the NCO resources chest below,
# and the arcane rune tome if storeArcaneRunes = 1.
@setvar! CFC_NCOmain 0x4F59860E
# --- ARCANE RUNE TOME: INSIDE NCO main, only used when storeArcaneRunes = 1 ---
# Boss runes from your backpack and the CFC Public Chest are added to it.
# Set to 0 to search NCO main for a rune tome (item 70158, hue 2085) instead.
@setvar! CFC_RuneTome 0x42CBB047
# --- BOSS TOKENS: container for boss tokens (main and mini) ---
# Can be inside NCO main or a chest within 2 tiles. Set to 0 to keep tokens in NCO main.
@setvar! CFC_Tokens 0x42244475
# --- NCO RESOURCES: chest INSIDE NCO main ---
# Gets raw food, leather, ingots, boards and seeds.
@setvar! CFC_NCOresources 0x4871BAC2

### OPTIONS ###
# If you want to drop off Arcane Runes, set to 1.
@setvar! storeArcaneRunes 1
# If you want to auto recycle magic items when recycler is full, set to 1.
@setvar! autoRecycle 1
#If you want to check the distros for stacked items, set to 1
@setvar! verify 1
#this adds leather to the rares list for testing purposes, set to 1
@setvar! debug 0
#TEMPORARY: while testing, your character says a warning in chat at the start, set to 0 to turn off
@setvar! testAnnounce 1
#checks for MCDs and Arcane Scrolls on the ground to determine if those should be tax or distro items
if findtype 17087 ground 0 any 8 as MCD
    sysmsg "Found MCD on ground, adding MCD to guild tax items" 818
    @setvar! taxMCDs 1
else
    @setvar! taxMCDs 0
endif
if findtype 3827 ground 2609 any 8 as pinkscrolls
    sysmsg "Found arcane scroll on ground, adding arcane scroll to guild tax items" 818
    @setvar! taxPinkScrolls 1
else
    @setvar! taxPinkScrolls 0
endif
if findtype 24434 ground 0 any 8 as researchmats
    sysmsg "Found research materials on ground, adding RMs to guild tax items" 818
    @setvar! taxRMs 1
else
    @setvar! taxRMs 0
endif

sysmsg 'BOSSLOOT-DROP-OFF Started _BosslootDropOffSingle' 44
if testAnnounce = 1
    say 'Testing drop off script, please use bottom distro if needed'
endif

# Magic items to Recycler (and auto recycle if you have it set to 1 at start)
if findtype '57484|57495|11761|11762' true as 'recycler'
    sysmsg 'Depositing unidentified items...' 14
    menu 'recycler' 1
        wait 1000
        if autoRecycle = 1
            getlabel recycler reclabel
            overhead reclabel 53
            if "(125 items," in reclabel
                overhead "Recycler full" 44
                dclick recycler
                wait 500
                waitforgump 4045111101
                gumpresponse 7
                waitforgump 4045111101
                gumpresponse 6
                waitforgump 4045111101
                gumpresponse 6
                waitforgump 4045111101
                gumpclose
                menu 'recycler' 1
                wait 1000
            endif
        endif
else
    sysmsg 'ITEM RECYCLER NOT FOUND. STOPPING.' 44
    stop
endif

if CFC_DistroOne != 0 and find CFC_DistroOne ground -1 -1 2
    @setvar BDODistroOne CFC_DistroOne
elseif not varexist BDODistroOne or not find BDODistroOne ground -1 -1 2
    overhead 'Select distro one'
    hotkey 'Clear Target Queue'
    @setvar BDODistroOne
    wft 500
    while targetexists
        wait 100
    endwhile
    getlabel BDODistroOne lbl
    if find BDODistroOne ground any any 2 and 'distribution chest' in lbl
        wait 500
        overhead 'Distro one set!' 14
        dclick BDODistroOne
        wait 500
    else
        overhead 'Wrong chest or too far away!' 44
        replay
    endif
endif

